[{"title":"游少林 其一","author":"区大相","text":"天下名山数少林，公馀乘兴一登临。\n黄花翠草凝禅意，白石清池惬赏心。\n竟日轮蹄忘去住，百年身世任浮沉。\n主僧知我耽诗癖，相引行吟到碧岑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游少林 其二","author":"区大相","text":"少林山前古梵宫，达摩曾此立禅宗。\n养龙崖废埋春草，卓锡泉甘自乳峰。\n出世不须钻故纸，传灯谁复继遗踪。\n吟馀策马东归去，回看云林隔暮钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游少林 其三","author":"区大相","text":"为爱山林景物稀，登临随处竟忘归。\n云迷竹树浓还淡，雨堕岩花湿不飞。\n养晦高人曾索价，谈禅老衲欲留衣。\n何妨结社重来此，一洗尘心是与非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游少林 其四","author":"区大相","text":"百丈山前佛寺开，春深缓辔一徘徊。\n落花细逐溪流去，好鸟低冲马首来。\n习静随缘餐笋蕨，看碑沿砌扫莓苔。\n放怀欲尽登临兴，可奈王程再四催。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日集海珠寺","author":"区大相","text":"清凉绀殿水云开，碧石晴江素练回。\n似有法王驱象至，岂无神女弄珠来。\n栖禅鹤下惊飞锡，听偈龙归引渡杯。\n日暮天花何处落，幽香长绕译经台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘社怀赵太史 其一","author":"区大相","text":"背郭楼成到碧虚，何人堪作上头居。\n金砂久秘神仙箓，玉笥新藏太史书。\n汉署几年违侍从，洛阳三入待公车。\n酒阑却忆瀛洲侣，黄鹄天风万里馀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"浮丘社怀赵太史 其二","author":"区大相","text":"紫气朝来满近关，千秋名胜在人间。\n杯前霞绕卢敖杖，海上涛飞葛令山。\n珠树岂曾吟落叶，丹砂聊得驻春颜。\n玉笙吹罢邀明月，又见孤城一鹤还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日登浮丘台","author":"区大相","text":"涧户灵泉闭泬寥，仙人楼阁五云遥。\n昆丘望去珠为树，蓬岛移来玉作桥。\n往日丹砂无客觅，他时黄鹤待谁招。\n飞云亦有升真路，缥缈如逢绛节朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"度大庾岭","author":"区大相","text":"关河谁设险，道路至今平。\n花树迷秦戍，风云捲汉旌。\n梯悬沧海日，楼望尉陀城。\n慎德今皇事，楼船罢远征。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"游七星岩","author":"区大相","text":"磴道纡回碧雾盘，玉虚宫阙上巑岏。\n何来灵气真人御，不尽长风大壑寒。\n洞口秋阴连薜荔，岩前空翠湿琅玕。\n丹梯袅袅非尘世，鸿雁冥冥愧羽翰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"仙源","author":"区大相","text":"闻有定心胜，闲来访给园。\n最怜幽密处，无客解寻源。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登崇熹塔","author":"区大伦","text":"圹漭孤标黛色开，百盘天外俯嵩台。\n江清日抱双龙出，峡迥云驱万马来。\n倚槛风烟看北极，傍檐星斗望中台。\n衣冠胜会千年事，何客重当作赋才。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自端溪溯流还石洲江上杂咏四首 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"封壤从知羲叔还，皇风亦在有虞间。\n汉家霸业何须论，西出楼船过锦山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自端溪溯流还石洲江上杂咏四首 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"灵羊东尽水为乡，两岸风传橘柚香。\n在处芷兰供客佩，教人无那说潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自端溪溯流还石洲江上杂咏四首 其三","author":"区大伦","text":"神仙应只在人间，尽说观棋去不还。\n寂寞霞踪谁过问，舟人指点烂柯山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23024,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自端溪溯流还石洲江上杂咏四首 其四","author":"区大伦","text":"长江面面接蘋洲，阳鸟偏多水国秋。\n桂楫兰桡冲不散，枉教回雁说衡州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23025,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南蓬书院讲道","author":"区大伦","text":"讲院初开日，如云弟子从。\n宫墙依坐虎，文字转雕龙。\n问礼存经曲，陈诗间鼓钟。\n百年勤学道，犹自愧儒宗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23026,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"在书院讲中行章咏","author":"区大伦","text":"中行一派浩千春，俗学寻源却未真。\n若道思归与狂简，当年吾道属何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23027,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"在书院讲舞雩章咏","author":"区大伦","text":"谩将春咏了残春，鲁叟当年只问津。\n若与唐虞誇气象，乾坤剩有咏归人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23028,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登南蓬山","author":"区大伦","text":"晨登蓬莱山，命我二三友。\n怀抱各清旷，稍厌从棼纠。\n理策即嵚岑，延眺极原薮。\n凉风荡衣裳，层峦映左右。\n西岭翠千重，东山亘长阜。\n齐云迥造天，回薄出南斗。\n江流浩渟泓，横岛障倾溜。\n洲渚跃波来，迅势若奔走。\n远浦网轻烟，前村荫疏柳。\n对景每自得，俯仰但搔首。\n岭云与溪月，一一供吾有。\n未知宇宙间，此乐可尽否。\n还顾望霞圃，咏归及樵叟。\n诘旦亦复然，兹游长负不。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23029,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石室山玉虚宫作","author":"区大伦","text":"云岩天上出，仙馆日边开。\n近对千峰合，遥临万象来。\n紫芝全覆岭，丹箓半含苔。\n复似登玄圃，笙歌发帝台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23030,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟汎漓江之石室游","author":"区大伦","text":"方舟汎潮返，潮满欲平流。\n日动漓江色，风含楚岸秋。\n岭云空翠合，津树晚烟浮。\n为问西来兴，将寻石室游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23031,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅庵","author":"区大伦","text":"江声带兰若，静者自相寻。\n白日寒山道，清风祇树林。\n竹梅开径浅，钟磬落云深。\n何必随空去，方知尘外心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23032,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪仲叔两兄汎舟?川晚溯大江 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"浮楫下?川，沿洄绿渚烟。\n水衔村径出，樯拂浦云悬。\n沙鸟依人静，汀花对酒妍。\n蒹葭别有思，何似雁行边。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23033,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陪仲叔两兄汎舟?川晚溯大江 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"溯洄江色暮，空水澹清秋。\n雾隐桄榔岸，潮平雁骛洲。\n管声川上发，槎影月中浮。\n便拟随星使，将寻天汉游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23034,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿横槎渡","author":"区大伦","text":"日落端江晚，维舟倚岸新。\n自多临汎意，不负水云身。\n野火收残市，寒潮下暝津。\n明朝溯洄去，应访武陵人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23035,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同宫允兄官棠山中寻梅 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"何处寻梅去，江村万玉林。\n雪堆山径浅，花发野塘深。\n瘦影悬疏月，幽香度远岑。\n瑶华如可结，相待岁寒心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23036,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同宫允兄官棠山中寻梅 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"容日寻芳入，蓬山几洞春。\n傍林花作友，倚树月随人。\n松石寒相映，冰霜晚见亲。\n湖山虽胜事，不断冶游尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23037,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南雍恭祀孔庙有述","author":"区大伦","text":"石城雍馆曙氤氲，秩祀神来俨苾芬。\n银汉清辉临宝炬，璧池瑞霭接祥云。\n牺陈俎豆欣初荐，凤叶箫韶恍昔闻。\n愿率骏奔群弟子，讲堂千古庆斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23038,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"大明天子自天成，睿德尧年颂圣明。\n更比世宗昭瑞应，黄河今为圣人清。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23039,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"合是天心启圣人，讴歌万国庆芳辰。\n韶光共道元年好，天子新开万岁春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23040,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其三","author":"区大伦","text":"今皇龙德本先天，大宝初开日月悬。\n见说万灵皆受职，闾阎新数太平年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23041,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其四","author":"区大伦","text":"高皇大业盛殷汤，远迈成周卜世长。\n今日文孙恢圣绪，由来祖德是重光。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23042,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其五","author":"区大伦","text":"文皇盛德在燕关，帝泽王风此日还。\n万国重瞻新日月，千年长抚旧河山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23043,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其六","author":"区大伦","text":"四海车书来会同，明堂天子布和风。\n悬知紫极氤氲处，春在青阳左介中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23044,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其七","author":"区大伦","text":"天回北极紫烟重，天子乘春御六龙。\n为报江湖须罢钓，云龙千载一相从。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23045,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其八","author":"区大伦","text":"千年一遇圣明君，八相平章昔未闻。\n可是九官重命日，诸公何以佐南薰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23046,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其九","author":"区大伦","text":"一诏从天许赐环，江湖犹复觐龙颜。\n虽逢礼乐遵虞典，那得夔龙便可攀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23047,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十","author":"区大伦","text":"锡宠偏多贵近臣，肘金横玉赐来新。\n主恩浩荡应难报，寄语诸贤莫爱身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23048,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十一","author":"区大伦","text":"紫殿催班侍讲筵，皇情初眷典谟篇。\n词臣献纳承恩遇，日捧牙签近御前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23049,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十二","author":"区大伦","text":"千官拥扈盛朝仪，谁念深宫进御时。\n保傅圣躬原不易，相臣勋业相臣知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23050,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十三","author":"区大伦","text":"自古冲人德业全，都从仆御慎周旋。\n周公若道还欺我，那得隆平八百年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23051,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十四","author":"区大伦","text":"在昔耕莘起帝臣，还从操筑见经纶。\n东山衡岳寻常事，好作和梅鼎铉人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23052,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十五","author":"区大伦","text":"帝宠元戎策武功，貔貅十万赴辽东。\n师人尽诏金钱赐，扫荡三韩指顾中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23053,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十六","author":"区大伦","text":"父老欢呼有赐书，尽停中使减诸胥。\n百城长吏应宣布，当使圣恩逮里闾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23054,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十七","author":"区大伦","text":"诏使衔恩出塞垣，金钱百万散营屯。\n从前肆市皆和虏，今日边城莫负恩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23055,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"天启元年歌 其十八","author":"区大伦","text":"帝泽如天草木春，三朝旷典一时新。\n微臣欲献中兴颂，愿比尧封祝圣人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23056,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓山吊古 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"自古兴亡地，厓山独怨歌。\n胡强由挟战，宋弱本言和。\n帷幄图功少，金缯误国多。\n更思朱镇事，流恨满沧波。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23057,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓山吊古 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"访古问渔樵，英雄泪未消。\n宋魂徒自远，楚些不须招。\n国事存厓石，臣心逐海潮。\n胡元何足恨，天意在明朝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23058,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门吊古 其一","author":"区大伦","text":"忆昔浮厓日，山河一苇存。\n三臣同恋主，列士总衔恩。\n海日乖殷夏，华夷易宋元。\n驱除圣主力，冠履正乾坤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23059,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"厓门吊古 其二","author":"区大伦","text":"厓门一片水，客至每愁增。\n断壁无元字，空山有宋陵。\n胶舟悲不返，填海恨常凝。\n千载经祠庙，凄然感废兴。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23060,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小金山送黎秘书还朝","author":"梁炫","text":"灵峰佳气郁，登览出岧峣。\n水带三城色，云连百粤遥。\n烟萝回曲径，梵刹逼层霄。\n未尽参禅意，张帆趁晚潮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23061,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初游飞来寺 其一","author":"梁炫","text":"两崖丛霭翠氤氲，到访诸天挹紫氛。\n曲径树啼山寺鸟，几重门锁比邱云。\n泉穿僧舍涓涓细，松带昙香隐隐闻。\n欲坐法岩习禅寂，不堪回首夕阳曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23062,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"初游飞来寺 其二","author":"梁炫","text":"飞来梁寺倚峰头，福地今看岭外收。\n千嶂坐当青霭合，一江遥瞰碧湾秋。\n楼间帝子空留蜕，岩畔高僧忘狎鸥。\n处处名山瑶草满，荷衣迟缀赤松游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23063,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招饮朝阳岩","author":"梁炫","text":"北海移尊觅胜游，朝晖浮动暮烟收。\n人从鸟道扪萝入，泉带雷声咽石流。\n古洞有碑苍藓合，閒云无伴野僧留。\n湘江迥隔红尘远，谁识人间有十洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23064,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登飞来高处","author":"梁炫","text":"登高直上最高峰，踏破烟岚路几重。\n山峭似当人面起，云生偏觉杖头浓。\n閒看株树巢归鹤，坐拾昙花制毒龙。\n翘首九阍何处是，自怜疏散类云踪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23065,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋先一日写怀","author":"梁炫","text":"闻说江枫动素商，天涯羁旅正茫茫。\n片帆鲈鲙乡心动，八载松楸客梦长。\n今夕不消愁酷暑，明朝应得试新凉。\n莫将旧绪萦秋况，且逐征鸿过楚阳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23066,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过徐太岩池馆","author":"梁炫","text":"徐卿台榭郡衙东，忆昔招游兴未穷。\n一自蕖荷凋肃露，漫令罗幌怯西风。\n不悲悬磬频司马，藉有遗书附阿戎。\n此日陇头留剑后，可堪回首夕阳东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23067,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋答宁上舍寄怀","author":"梁炫","text":"波漾冰盘上碧空，旅怀尊酒对孤蓬。\n四时月色唯今好，九十秋期此正中。\n断续笛声来远浦，两三鸿影度江枫。\n相思翘首天南北，坐对清光知与同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23068,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"邸中答友人","author":"梁炫","text":"闭门短发日萧搔，湖海风尘染素袍。\n自笑懒于嵇叔夜，寒暄久矣负山涛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23069,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其一","author":"梁炫","text":"论交且勿笑陈馀，世态由来贵贱殊。\n陌上相逢不相识，匣中犹有旧来书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23070,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"即事 其二","author":"梁炫","text":"难凭结谊定黄金，一日须教一日新。\n用尽黄金便疏索，白头还是陌头人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23071,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阙题 其一","author":"王玠","text":"古寺东郊外，相传延祚来。\n钟声飞汉度，玉峡枕江开。\n入定虚丹灶，寻真破绿苔。\n玉环人幻化，洞口野猿哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23072,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阙题 其二","author":"王玠","text":"出郭寻芳寺，逢僧话旧游。\n光阴浑逆旅，身世自虚舟。\n月落诸天静，猿啼万壑幽。\n定心泉下水，长护绿云流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23073,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读王奉常敬羙公所撰先君光禄公墓志铭感赋","author":"潘益之","text":"窆石何因乞鼎言，开函字字泪潺湲。\n两朝芹曝臣心切，一日丝纶帝命尊。\n虚拟杖藜游五岳，尚馀词藻动中原。\n趋庭往事今流水，万卷空馀手泽存。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23074,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"展先光禄墓","author":"潘益之","text":"名山长瞰鉴江楼，佳气青葱结一丘。\n自荷先朝深雨露，可堪今日抚松楸。\n碑留宿草终天恨，风度啼乌入暮愁。\n八十五龄肋力竭，有怀明发未能休。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23075,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"长儿宪龙书报盘莲盛花待余归日称开九帙","author":"潘益之","text":"开缄字字见情真，伏枕犹能忆老亲。\n本为江山淹作客，却令风月待归人。\n浮邱洞口穷双目，穗石坛边寄一身。\n闻道白莲娇欲语，始知吾社未全贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23076,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同张秘书孟奇夜宿西樵四峰书院","author":"潘益之","text":"一入名山海宇宽，故人清夜此追欢。\n閒来杖屦林为藉，兴远烟霞箨是冠。\n百道飞泉风更急，满庭残叶夏偏寒。\n天街月色凉何限，七十峰头枕上看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23077,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题江头渔聚","author":"梁维梓","text":"津头流水碧漪漪，断岸归舟晚自移。\n孺子歌残明月上，数声渔唱隔江湄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23078,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"飞来寺","author":"何予高","text":"飞寺曾闻选胜来，依然绝巘隐蓬莱。\n山封秘检云为幕，石撼狂泉雪作堆。\n万丈潭花金锁寂，四时春谷紫榴开。\n青宵何事不成寐，风静禅堂月满台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":23079,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}}]